  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$x \\frac{d y}{d x}+y=x \\frac{f(x y)}{f^{\\prime}(x y)} \\Rightarrow \\frac{d(x y)}{d x}=x \\frac{f(x y)}{f^{\\prime}(x y)} \\Rightarrow \\frac{f^{\\prime}(x y)}{f(x y)} d(x y)=x d x \\Rightarrow \\ln |f(x y)|=\\frac{x^2}{2}+k \\Rightarrow f(x y)=C e^{\\frac{x^2}{2}}$",
